{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00403","headline":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 太和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 太和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郊坛斋帝，礼乐祀天。\n丹青寰宇，宫徵山川。\n神只毕降，行止重旋。\n融融穆穆，纳祉洪延。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}